  "scenario": "utility-intent",
  "what": "\u00a77.3a 'fire OI! and drop a cone only on purpose, never from a cancelled touch' (P1-S08). Four Cruz Missiles drive slowly down the greybox's back straight side by side, each player's sticks going through jj-input's source machine as a host pad's do. Car 0 flicks ACTION up, lets go, then flicks it down: one OI! and one cone. Car 1 holds ACTION up for 1.5 s: one OI! (the sector needs a neutral re-arm to fire again). Car 2 pushes ACTION most of the way up and down without reaching the sector: nothing. Car 3's touch heads up and is cancelled (a pointercancel) before it gets there, then sits on the exact diagonal between up and right: nothing. Baselines: no input and no ACTION stick fire nothing at all.",
